Adventure "The Lighthouse":
    Begin at Dock.

Scene Dock:
    Narrate "You step onto the dock below the lighthouse."
    Proceed to Tower.

Scene Tower:
    Narrate "The beacon is ready to light."
    Option "Return to the dock" leads to Dock.
    Option "Light the beacon" leads to BeaconLit.

Scene BeaconLit:
    Narrate "The beacon guides the ship safely toward shore."
    Conclude.
